message: "Please cite this version of the reproducibility artifact when using the proof or construction checks."
title: "Project Lemma: The First Mills Number on Fourteen Vertices"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Valiyaparampil
    given-names: Troy
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for the q = 3 case of Füredi's conjecture.
  The manuscript and Lean 4 development establish L(14) = M1(14) = 7/23
  and the maximum fractional matching number 23/7. The repository includes
  a formal proof, construction verifiers, a comparison with covering records,
  and documentation of AI-developed mathematics and formalization.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - covering designs
  - intersecting hypergraphs
  - fractional matchings
  - first Mills number
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
